WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.350
<b>#2   New Life</b>

00:00.910 --> 00:01.860
<b>Listen...</b>

00:01.860 --> 00:04.360
<b>Don't even mention the word "marriage".</b>

00:04.870 --> 00:06.900
<b>It's bad news if someone hears it.</b>

00:06.900 --> 00:08.170
<b>I know.</b>

00:10.350 --> 00:12.120
<b>Morning, you two!</b>

00:12.120 --> 00:14.370
<b>What were you talking about with Saito?</b>

00:14.370 --> 00:17.000
<b>N-Nothing.</b>

00:17.380 --> 00:20.960
<b>Oh? Weren't you angry at him?</b>

00:20.960 --> 00:24.000
<b>I just told him to stop talking
to me so nonchalantly!</b>

00:24.820 --> 00:27.470
<b>It's you who came to me...</b>

00:30.470 --> 00:32.150
<b>Wh-What?</b>

00:33.660 --> 00:36.820
<b>Cousin, your shampoo smells different.</b>

00:36.820 --> 00:38.850
<b>Where did you stay last night?</b>

00:38.850 --> 00:41.600
<b>Dad just bought this weird shampoo, so...</b>

00:41.600 --> 00:43.570
<b>Not just the shampoo.</b>

00:43.570 --> 00:45.730
<b>You also reek of a girl.</b>

00:46.270 --> 00:47.030
<b>Ow!</b>

00:47.420 --> 00:48.410
<b>Don't bite me.</b>

00:48.410 --> 00:50.740
<b>You got married, didn't you?</b>

00:51.760 --> 00:52.740
<b>How did you...</b>

00:52.740 --> 00:56.580
<b>Our grandpa and his company
were acting strange, so I looked into it.</b>

00:56.580 --> 00:58.750
<b>I also know where your new house is.</b>

00:58.750 --> 01:02.090
<b>You are married to that Sakuramori...</b>

01:05.920 --> 01:08.630
<b>I am not obligated
to keep my mouth shut.</b>

01:09.070 --> 01:12.760
<b>You didn't tell me anything
before your marriage either.</b>

01:12.760 --> 01:14.390
<b>Well...</b>

01:14.890 --> 01:17.840
<b>I request a bribe for this.</b>

01:17.840 --> 01:19.020
<b>What?</b>

01:21.010 --> 01:24.410
<b>A bribe... A bribe...</b>

01:24.410 --> 01:26.020
<b>Bribe?</b>

01:28.800 --> 01:30.780
<b>Can't come up with anything?</b>

01:31.230 --> 01:33.330
<b>I'll eventually do.</b>

01:33.330 --> 01:38.080
<b>Your life is in the palm of my hand now.</b>

01:38.720 --> 01:42.540
<b>One sure gets drowsy after phys ed...
This is trouble.</b>

01:42.940 --> 01:45.790
<b>Cut the crap already!</b>

01:45.790 --> 01:47.020
<b>What?</b>

01:47.020 --> 01:50.460
<b>I'm talking about the phys ed equipment!
You just put them outside, didn't you!</b>

01:50.460 --> 01:52.270
<b>Put them inside the storehouse!</b>

01:52.270 --> 01:55.560
<b>Our neighbours are using them
for their next class.</b>

01:55.560 --> 01:57.560
<b>It'll help them
if I put the equipment there.</b>

01:57.560 --> 01:59.560
<b>How can you tell?!</b>

01:59.910 --> 02:01.810
<b>I already checked with the teacher!</b>

02:01.810 --> 02:03.600
<b>Oh, I see!</b>

02:03.600 --> 02:07.550
<b>Akane and I put them back inside,
but I guess that was uncalled for.</b>

02:07.550 --> 02:11.070
<b>What if a meteor struck
and they couldn't do phys ed?!</b>

02:11.070 --> 02:14.530
<b>I'd pin it on you if the people taking shelter
in the gymnasium tripped and fell!</b>

02:14.530 --> 02:16.660
<b>Now that's an extreme
what-if you're proposing!</b>

02:16.660 --> 02:18.260
<b>They're at it again.</b>

02:18.260 --> 02:19.500
<b>They never get bored, huh...</b>

02:19.500 --> 02:21.160
<b>They're just too close.</b>

02:21.160 --> 02:23.180
<b>Again? What do they mean?</b>

02:23.180 --> 02:24.660
<b>You don't know?</b>

02:24.660 --> 02:27.490
<b>You're always at each other's throats,</b>

02:27.490 --> 02:29.800
<b>so you're getting famous
among the students.</b>

02:30.210 --> 02:34.010
<b>They say you're like the Real Couple Ch.,
or the married comedy duo.</b>

02:34.010 --> 02:36.580
<b>We're not a married couple!</b>

02:36.580 --> 02:39.010
<b>But we are...</b>

02:43.390 --> 02:44.760
<b>I'm Getting Married to a Girl</b>

02:44.760 --> 02:46.350
<b>I Hate in My Class</b>

04:10.020 --> 04:11.840
<b>What is this?!</b>

04:11.840 --> 04:12.560
<b>Hmm?</b>

04:14.880 --> 04:16.110
<b>What's up?</b>

04:16.760 --> 04:18.610
<b>It's all juice inside!</b>

04:18.610 --> 04:22.170
<b>I bought those cans of concentrated
vegetable juice.</b>

04:22.170 --> 04:26.120
<b>It's full of vitamins,
so I'll get healthy enough by drinking this!</b>

04:26.120 --> 04:28.750
<b>No, you won't!
That's not enough nutrition!</b>

04:29.310 --> 04:30.880
<b>In that case...</b>

04:32.250 --> 04:34.250
<b>Is it so good, you'd scream?</b>

04:34.250 --> 04:35.270
<b>You're right to do so!</b>

04:35.270 --> 04:39.510
<b>For cup noodles are the perfect food,
so cheap, so quick, and so good!</b>

04:39.510 --> 04:42.510
<b>Just out of curiosity,
but where do you get your proteins?</b>

04:42.510 --> 04:44.510
<b>Humanity has invented protein shakes!</b>

04:44.930 --> 04:49.770
<b>It is an ideal protein shake with
the perfect ratio of whey and casein!</b>

04:49.770 --> 04:52.150
<b>Add the vegetable juice...</b>

04:52.480 --> 04:54.320
<b>And it's done! Want some?</b>

04:54.320 --> 04:55.570
<b>No way!</b>

04:55.950 --> 05:00.970
<b>Are you planning to live only on cup noodles,
vegetable juice, and protein shakes?</b>

05:00.970 --> 05:03.070
<b>They're the easiest to cook, after all.</b>

05:03.070 --> 05:05.840
<b>They're not! You can't call that cooking!</b>

05:05.840 --> 05:07.450
<b>It's all just chemistry!</b>

05:07.450 --> 05:08.970
<b>But it's good for your body!</b>

05:08.970 --> 05:10.750
<b>Get that poison off me!</b>

05:10.750 --> 05:12.890
<b>How dare you make fun of my masterpiece!</b>

05:12.890 --> 05:14.840
<b>Your taste buds are just weird!</b>

05:15.170 --> 05:18.330
<b>How rude!
I I made an effort to make them numb!</b>

05:18.330 --> 05:23.340
<b>How long do you think it took me
to not perceive this thing as a putrid liquid?!</b>

05:23.890 --> 05:26.880
<b>He's more dangerous than I thought.</b>

05:26.880 --> 05:31.620
<b>If I leave him be, he'll die,
and when he dies, our marriage will...</b>

05:32.260 --> 05:35.730
<b>This is for my own good, not his.</b>

05:36.380 --> 05:39.740
<b>I'll show you what real cooking is.</b>

05:40.180 --> 05:42.260
<b>No, thanks.
I have my elixir here...</b>

05:42.260 --> 05:44.490
<b>Just sit tight and observe!</b>

05:49.300 --> 05:52.120
<b>He looks just like a hungry puppy.</b>

05:52.530 --> 05:55.600
<b>I bet he'll be super surprised
once he tastes this.</b>

05:55.600 --> 05:58.930
<b>He'll praise me for the food,
and thank me from the bottom of his heart.</b>

05:58.930 --> 06:02.500
<b>Then he'll realise that
I'm far more skilful than him!</b>

06:03.630 --> 06:06.160
<b>Girl, you're creeping me out
with that smirking.</b>

06:06.160 --> 06:09.890
<b>Hey, I'm making your dinner here!
Don't be so rude!</b>

06:09.890 --> 06:12.250
<b>Is she putting poison inside?</b>

06:12.250 --> 06:14.220
<b>Will this be my last supper...?</b>

06:19.040 --> 06:20.630
<b>Eat your fill now.</b>

06:21.110 --> 06:23.530
<b>I'll definitely bring you down today!</b>

06:23.530 --> 06:26.150
<b>Any nails or explosives...?</b>

06:26.930 --> 06:28.280
<b>None so far...</b>

06:28.280 --> 06:29.710
<b>Well, duh!</b>

06:29.710 --> 06:31.290
<b>Just get that to your mouth already!</b>

06:51.930 --> 06:53.530
<b>Well?</b>

06:53.530 --> 06:54.690
<b>Is it good?</b>

06:57.630 --> 06:59.020
<b>It's normal...</b>

06:59.750 --> 07:02.570
<b>Just a normal meal, gently cooked.</b>

07:03.270 --> 07:06.030
<b>But it means more than anything to me...</b>

07:06.030 --> 07:07.260
<b>Then don't eat it!</b>

07:07.260 --> 07:10.450
<b>Why?! We've come this far,
so no refunds, come on!</b>

07:10.450 --> 07:12.420
<b>If it doesn't taste good,
then don't eat it!</b>

07:12.420 --> 07:14.330
<b>I'll just give this to the dog outside!</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:16.390
<b>I didn't say it tasted bad!</b>

07:16.390 --> 07:18.830
<b>You also didn't say it tasted good!</b>

07:18.830 --> 07:22.230
<b>Give it back! This is a thief!
Dine and dash!</b>

07:22.230 --> 07:25.840
<b>Give it up!
You're out of luck for giving me food!</b>

07:28.050 --> 07:32.680
<b>You demon!
I'll resent you forever!</b>

07:33.030 --> 07:35.210
<b>Such a fulfilling dinner...</b>

07:35.210 --> 07:37.940
<b>...and eating my whole meal,
only to be resented afterwards...</b>

07:37.940 --> 07:39.270
<b>...is a first for me.</b>

07:42.190 --> 07:44.940
<b>Wake up. Come on!</b>

07:46.330 --> 07:49.580
<b>Shisei... We're still good...</b>

07:49.580 --> 07:51.430
<b>Should sleep for some more...</b>

08:00.820 --> 08:04.110
<b>Why, you...</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:08.350
<b>I'm telling you to get your ass up!</b>

08:10.400 --> 08:14.080
<b>Sorry. Didn't think you'd
come to wake me up.</b>

08:14.080 --> 08:17.520
<b>Nay! I came to scold you!</b>

08:17.520 --> 08:18.310
<b>Scold?</b>

08:18.310 --> 08:20.690
<b>Why did you leave the dishes like that?</b>

08:20.690 --> 08:24.370
<b>I made you dinner last night,
so you were supposed to do the dishes!</b>

08:24.370 --> 08:26.570
<b>Oh, just use the available utensils.</b>

08:26.570 --> 08:28.570
<b>I'll do the dishes once they stack up.</b>

08:28.570 --> 08:30.570
<b>Wash them now!</b>

08:31.110 --> 08:33.360
<b>You left the toilet paper refills scattered.</b>

08:33.360 --> 08:36.580
<b>And the soap bag in the bathroom
is also on the floor.</b>

08:36.940 --> 08:39.330
<b>Are you trying to turn
this house into a jungle?!</b>

08:39.760 --> 08:42.170
<b>Hey, you can clean up
the rubbish once a month, right?</b>

08:43.070 --> 08:45.410
<b>A-Are you for real?</b>

08:45.900 --> 08:47.880
<b>And you call yourself a human?</b>

08:47.880 --> 08:49.450
<b>I am trying to be one.</b>

08:49.450 --> 08:52.760
<b>Do not deny rubbish.
Live in harmony with rubbish.</b>

08:52.760 --> 08:54.620
<b>I don't want to live with rubbish!</b>

08:54.620 --> 08:57.270
<b>I want to live a clean,
proper and beautiful life!</b>

08:57.270 --> 08:59.520
<b>I'm not that much of a clean freak.</b>

08:59.520 --> 09:02.570
<b>To be honest, I'm also questioning
the significance of taking a bath.</b>

09:02.570 --> 09:04.900
<b>Why would you even question that?!</b>

09:05.690 --> 09:09.030
<b>I can't believe I'm living under
the same roof with someone like you...</b>

09:09.030 --> 09:11.530
<b>We're living together
for our own interests, right?</b>

09:11.870 --> 09:14.070
<b>Don't pry too much into my life.</b>

09:14.070 --> 09:15.810
<b>What the heck?</b>

09:20.070 --> 09:22.540
<b>We have the opposite values...</b>

09:22.950 --> 09:24.640
<b>Can we even make it?</b>

09:29.920 --> 09:33.060
<b>No better stress relievers
than video games!</b>

09:33.630 --> 09:36.140
<b>You're too noisy,
I can't focus here!</b>

09:36.570 --> 09:37.420
<b>Hey...</b>

09:37.890 --> 09:39.640
<b>Why are you playing a weird game?!</b>

09:39.640 --> 09:41.560
<b>It's not a weird game.</b>

09:41.560 --> 09:44.800
<b>It's a community-based
zombie hunting action game.</b>

09:44.800 --> 09:47.280
<b>I must defeat the zombies
emerging in the nation,</b>

09:47.280 --> 09:49.670
<b>- in each prefecture's landmarks...
- Who cares about the game?!</b>

09:49.670 --> 09:51.780
<b>It's disgusting, turn it off!</b>

09:51.780 --> 09:53.620
<b>But it's not.</b>

09:53.620 --> 09:57.600
<b>I've already reduced the amount
of gibs in the settings to 40%.</b>

09:57.600 --> 09:59.230
<b>That's not the issue here!</b>

09:59.230 --> 10:02.770
<b>I can't fathom anyone
who'd play violent video games!</b>

10:02.770 --> 10:05.050
<b>They're bound to commit crimes!</b>

10:05.050 --> 10:08.170
<b>That's a narrow point of view.
Don't you generalise someone's hobby.</b>

10:08.170 --> 10:10.390
<b>I'm telling you
to not play this in my house!</b>

10:10.390 --> 10:12.210
<b>This is half my house too!</b>

10:12.210 --> 10:14.240
<b>You're just a freeloader!</b>

10:14.240 --> 10:15.300
<b>But why?!</b>

10:15.300 --> 10:17.540
<b>Anyway, no video games in this house!</b>

10:17.540 --> 10:19.710
<b>Nooo!</b>

10:19.710 --> 10:20.880
<b>Who could it be?</b>

10:20.880 --> 10:22.730
<b>Don't just let go!</b>

10:23.980 --> 10:26.190
<b>It's more of your belongings.</b>

10:28.730 --> 10:30.190
<b>What's gotten into you?</b>

10:34.270 --> 10:35.820
<b>My belongings...</b>

10:35.820 --> 10:38.170
<b>It's all here now.</b>

10:42.450 --> 10:45.460
<b>Tomorrow shall await another fierce battle.</b>

10:45.460 --> 10:48.530
<b>In order for this warrior
to recover from his wounds,</b>

10:48.530 --> 10:50.860
<b>he must take a bath!</b>

11:12.420 --> 11:13.820
<b>Strange...</b>

11:14.320 --> 11:18.390
<b>It's just too unusual for her
to not notice me at all...</b>

11:19.180 --> 11:20.900
<b>Did she pass out?!</b>

11:21.740 --> 11:25.590
<b>Hey! Answer me if you're alive!</b>

11:27.770 --> 11:30.290
<b>Survive, will you?!
Don't give up!</b>

11:30.290 --> 11:31.590
<b>Hey!</b>

11:36.640 --> 11:38.420
<b>Oh, she's just asleep...</b>

11:39.040 --> 11:42.430
<b>Wait, people have drowned in the past
from sleeping in the bath.</b>

11:42.430 --> 11:44.350
<b>Wake up! Sun's up for you!</b>

11:45.690 --> 11:48.850
<b>So you finally admitted defeat...</b>

11:48.850 --> 11:53.370
<b>If you apologise on your knees,
I'll let you live in a dog house.</b>

11:53.370 --> 11:55.490
<b>Maybe I should let her be?</b>

12:07.130 --> 12:09.040
<b>Saito, you idiot...</b>

12:09.040 --> 12:11.130
<b>Are you trying to kill me?!</b>

12:14.180 --> 12:14.830
<b>Wha...</b>

12:15.450 --> 12:16.710
<b>What is this...</b>

12:16.710 --> 12:19.260
<b>Why am I naked with you...</b>

12:19.260 --> 12:20.610
<b>Is this sexual harassment?</b>

12:20.610 --> 12:21.800
<b>Sexual battery?</b>

12:21.800 --> 12:24.810
<b>Calm down, let me explain...</b>

12:26.810 --> 12:31.220
<b>I can't believe you, pervert!
Get out! Get out of this house!</b>

12:31.220 --> 12:33.320
<b>Leave this planet already!</b>

12:33.320 --> 12:35.070
<b>At least kick me out to the Earth!</b>

12:35.070 --> 12:36.940
<b>I haven't done anything wrong!</b>

12:36.940 --> 12:41.160
<b>Like there's nothing wrong with you
sneaking in on a girl bathing?!</b>

12:41.160 --> 12:42.890
<b>That's...</b>

12:42.890 --> 12:45.040
<b>It's hard to explain...</b>

12:45.440 --> 12:46.570
<b>You...</b>

12:47.410 --> 12:49.060
<b>You saw it all, right?</b>

12:49.060 --> 12:53.040
<b>My breasts... and what's below too?</b>

12:53.040 --> 12:54.970
<b>No...</b>

12:55.800 --> 13:00.820
<b>You're the worst! Begone!
Don't get in the bath again!</b>

13:03.230 --> 13:04.910
<b>A boy saw me naked...</b>

13:04.910 --> 13:07.560
<b>And he's my greatest nemesis of a classmate...</b>

13:11.220 --> 13:14.220
<b>But a lot has happened,
so I go tired...</b>

13:14.220 --> 13:16.070
<b>And I fell asleep back there...</b>

13:16.780 --> 13:18.190
<b>Maybe...</b>

13:18.190 --> 13:21.970
<b>He was trying to save me?</b>

13:31.080 --> 13:32.790
<b>U-Um...</b>

13:32.790 --> 13:33.990
<b>What?</b>

13:33.990 --> 13:36.540
<b>Well, about earlier...</b>

13:36.540 --> 13:37.340
<b>I'm going to bed.</b>

13:38.790 --> 13:43.090
<b>Oh, go on, then!
It's nothing important anyway!</b>

13:50.780 --> 13:54.100
<b>What's up, Akane?
Why the sadness today?</b>

13:56.560 --> 13:57.860
<b>Himari...</b>

13:58.250 --> 14:01.110
<b>Himari!</b>

14:03.390 --> 14:06.620
<b>Someone you're on bad terms with,
but want to befriend?</b>

14:06.620 --> 14:08.370
<b>Are we talking about Saito?</b>

14:08.370 --> 14:11.000
<b>No way!
Why would you even bring him up?!</b>

14:11.000 --> 14:15.460
<b>But you seem to be curious
about Saito since last year.</b>

14:15.460 --> 14:19.250
<b>I'm not! Anyone but him, like, at all!</b>

14:20.740 --> 14:22.630
<b>That so?</b>

14:22.630 --> 14:24.450
<b>Anyway, I've just had it with the guy!</b>

14:24.450 --> 14:27.640
<b>If I keep arguing with them,
I'll turn crazy from the stress!</b>

14:28.400 --> 14:32.690
<b>Let's see... For starters...</b>

14:32.690 --> 14:34.340
<b>I'll just hug the person!</b>

14:34.340 --> 14:38.590
<b>Huh? No way, I can't do that to them.</b>

14:38.590 --> 14:41.030
<b>Then, how about talking it over?</b>

14:41.030 --> 14:45.010
<b>Most people would understand
if you talk to them.</b>

14:45.010 --> 14:46.540
<b>Well...</b>

14:46.540 --> 14:49.020
<b>Isn't that because they talk with you?</b>

14:49.020 --> 14:52.040
<b>You're a master at communicating,
and no one hates you.</b>

14:52.040 --> 14:54.180
<b>That's not true.</b>

14:54.180 --> 14:57.370
<b>There are some people
I can't get along with.</b>

14:57.900 --> 15:00.400
<b>So, you'll be fine.</b>

15:00.400 --> 15:04.320
<b>What matters isn't that you
should make them respect you,</b>

15:04.320 --> 15:06.300
<b>but you respect them.</b>

15:06.790 --> 15:08.150
<b>Respect them?</b>

15:10.470 --> 15:12.710
<b>Cousin, are you not hungry?</b>

15:12.710 --> 15:14.960
<b>My house is a living hell.</b>

15:14.960 --> 15:17.680
<b>Whenever she has time,
she'd just bicker at me.</b>

15:17.680 --> 15:20.320
<b>Do you really think
I can eat with such a mood?</b>

15:22.550 --> 15:23.820
<b>What if you get a divorce?</b>

15:23.820 --> 15:25.890
<b>I can't do that.</b>

15:25.890 --> 15:30.380
<b>If I run away now, I won't know
what I gave my life to Grandpa for.</b>

15:30.900 --> 15:34.200
<b>I need to obtain Hojo Group.</b>

15:34.200 --> 15:37.390
<b>I don't want you to suffer.</b>

15:37.390 --> 15:41.170
<b>If you can't get a divorce,
you have just to get along with Akane.</b>

15:41.170 --> 15:45.210
<b>That's not happening.
Our personalities don't match.</b>

15:45.210 --> 15:49.340
<b>You know we're no match
for each other mentally, right?</b>

15:49.760 --> 15:51.650
<b>Humans are animals,</b>

15:51.650 --> 15:54.330
<b>so I think there are some
types incompatible to them.</b>

15:54.330 --> 15:56.750
<b>But not you, Cousin.</b>

15:56.750 --> 15:58.100
<b>You're just being negligent.</b>

15:58.420 --> 15:59.580
<b>Negligent?</b>

15:59.580 --> 16:03.650
<b>People with different preferences, thoughts,
and concepts of common sense,</b>

16:03.650 --> 16:06.700
<b>are simply unable
to get along as they are.</b>

16:06.700 --> 16:10.710
<b>Have you ever tried to concede to Akane?</b>

16:10.710 --> 16:12.000
<b>Well...</b>

16:12.490 --> 16:17.220
<b>It's important to understand
how she feels, and control it.</b>

16:17.220 --> 16:20.500
<b>If you're going to be the CEO,
you must be able to do that.</b>

16:20.970 --> 16:22.500
<b>You're right...</b>

16:22.500 --> 16:25.420
<b>We have come to one conclusion now.</b>

16:25.420 --> 16:28.760
<b>You will have to carry me
in your arms.</b>

16:28.760 --> 16:29.760
<b>For what?!</b>

16:30.210 --> 16:32.670
<b>Most maidens will fall for this.</b>

16:32.670 --> 16:33.470
<b>Huh?!</b>

16:36.670 --> 16:37.910
<b>I'm back...</b>

16:40.330 --> 16:43.020
<b>I'll just... not do that today.</b>

16:43.020 --> 16:44.020
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

16:44.020 --> 16:45.280
<b>...Talk...</b>

16:45.280 --> 16:46.280
<b>Huh?</b>

16:46.280 --> 16:49.190
<b>I said, let's talk.</b>

16:49.190 --> 16:50.560
<b>About a divorce?</b>

16:50.560 --> 16:55.900
<b>Not that! I want to talk about
how we can maintain our m-marriage!</b>

16:56.880 --> 16:59.660
<b>I want to discuss
how we can get along well.</b>

16:59.660 --> 17:04.170
<b>Not that I want to,
but I can't just break up with you now.</b>

17:04.650 --> 17:06.510
<b>I can't have that too.</b>

17:08.450 --> 17:09.930
<b>I've been thinking.</b>

17:10.320 --> 17:14.270
<b>I hate you, but if I have to live with you,</b>

17:14.270 --> 17:17.010
<b>it's better to make this place
more comfortable.</b>

17:17.010 --> 17:18.320
<b>Agreed.</b>

17:18.320 --> 17:19.940
<b>I don't want to live in hell.</b>

17:19.940 --> 17:21.560
<b>Hell?! How rude!</b>

17:21.560 --> 17:23.950
<b>Let's see...</b>

17:23.950 --> 17:28.070
<b>How about setting some rules
so we don't get stressed out?</b>

17:28.390 --> 17:29.380
<b>Rules?</b>

17:29.380 --> 17:32.590
<b>If we set up some borders
that you and I are comfortable with,</b>

17:32.590 --> 17:35.610
<b>we won't have to argue so much, right?</b>

17:35.610 --> 17:37.330
<b>I see...</b>

17:37.780 --> 17:40.010
<b>Let's talk about housework, then.</b>

17:40.010 --> 17:42.960
<b>Ever since we got married,
I've been doing it all alone.</b>

17:43.490 --> 17:47.450
<b>I prefer washing my clothes and dishes
when they're piled up already.</b>

17:47.450 --> 17:48.880
<b>I'm all about efficiency.</b>

17:48.880 --> 17:49.980
<b>Bugs will come in!</b>

17:49.980 --> 17:51.790
<b>It's only a natural thing.</b>

17:51.790 --> 17:53.620
<b>Yeah, I don't want to be one with nature!</b>

17:53.620 --> 17:55.660
<b>Leave them be, and they'll be
full of germs, turning you sick!</b>

17:55.660 --> 17:57.510
<b>Do the laundry every day,
even if you hate it!</b>

17:58.520 --> 18:00.210
<b>All right.</b>

18:00.210 --> 18:02.770
<b>I'll do the laundry from time to time.</b>

18:02.770 --> 18:05.870
<b>Really? That'll be helpful.</b>

18:05.870 --> 18:08.170
<b>Don't you have a request?</b>

18:08.170 --> 18:10.430
<b>You're asking my opinion?</b>

18:10.430 --> 18:13.280
<b>I'd listen to any reasonable opinion.</b>

18:13.280 --> 18:15.340
<b>Well...</b>

18:15.340 --> 18:19.040
<b>I'd like you to bear with
my touching your body in the bed...</b>

18:19.040 --> 18:21.040
<b>So you want me
to allow sexual harassment?!</b>

18:21.040 --> 18:22.030
<b>You lecherous guy!</b>

18:22.030 --> 18:25.920
<b>No! I'm telling you to overlook my bumping
into you since our bed is cramped!</b>

18:26.390 --> 18:31.540
<b>O-Okay... You can touch my body.</b>

18:31.540 --> 18:34.320
<b>But just through my clothes, okay?</b>

18:34.320 --> 18:37.930
<b>I won't forgive you
if you touch inside my clothes.</b>

18:37.930 --> 18:42.990
<b>You should play horror games with headphones,
and don't play them when I'm around.</b>

18:42.990 --> 18:44.620
<b>Are you scared?</b>

18:44.620 --> 18:48.150
<b>No, it's just distracting!</b>

18:49.280 --> 18:51.860
<b>We've settled on the basic rules, then.</b>

18:51.860 --> 18:53.150
<b>Well, yeah...</b>

18:53.460 --> 18:56.150
<b>Also, I read this in a book,</b>

18:56.150 --> 19:00.420
<b>but if you say thank you out loud,
this will improve a relationship.</b>

19:00.420 --> 19:02.630
<b>So you want us to thank each other?</b>

19:02.630 --> 19:04.160
<b>Even for the smallest things.</b>

19:05.840 --> 19:07.230
<b>In that case...</b>

19:07.230 --> 19:10.920
<b>You should say my cooking tastes good.</b>

19:10.920 --> 19:12.110
<b>Even if it tastes normal?</b>

19:12.110 --> 19:16.320
<b>Even if it does!
Cooking for someone takes effort, mind you!</b>

19:16.320 --> 19:19.930
<b>If I hear you say, "It's normal,"
it'll just ruin my mood after all the effort!</b>

19:20.270 --> 19:23.430
<b>Saying "normal" is a praise for me, though.</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:25.080
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

19:25.080 --> 19:28.300
<b>It'll be too long to explain.
About a week.</b>

19:28.300 --> 19:29.690
<b>That's too long!</b>

19:30.860 --> 19:33.610
<b>I don't think we've got closer...</b>

19:33.610 --> 19:35.310
<b>No good, huh?</b>

19:35.310 --> 19:37.460
<b>But we could talk with each other.</b>

19:37.460 --> 19:39.040
<b>We talked for 5 hours.</b>

19:39.040 --> 19:40.330
<b>I'm so beat.</b>

19:40.330 --> 19:41.690
<b>Glad to hear that.</b>

19:41.690 --> 19:43.100
<b>You're one step forward now.</b>

19:43.100 --> 19:45.900
<b>Thanks.
It's all thanks to you, Himari.</b>

19:45.900 --> 19:47.690
<b>See you tomorrow.</b>

19:52.220 --> 19:53.870
<b>Here...</b>

19:54.390 --> 19:57.590
<b>You can... touch my body...</b>

19:58.480 --> 20:00.600
<b>I won't touch you on purpose!</b>

20:03.230 --> 20:05.600
<b>It's been a while
since we walked home together.</b>

20:05.600 --> 20:07.010
<b>I'm so happy.</b>

20:07.010 --> 20:09.340
<b>I've been so busy these days.</b>

20:09.340 --> 20:11.730
<b>Has your war with Akane ended?</b>

20:11.730 --> 20:13.510
<b>No, it hasn't...</b>

20:13.510 --> 20:15.610
<b>But I think I'm willing to reconcile.</b>

20:15.860 --> 20:16.580
<b>You mean this?</b>

20:16.580 --> 20:17.840
<b>Now that's raw.</b>

20:17.840 --> 20:18.820
<b>The beach ball?</b>

20:18.820 --> 20:19.870
<b>Stop confusing me!</b>

20:21.410 --> 20:23.910
<b>Anyway, tag along with me.</b>

20:25.460 --> 20:26.530
<b>What's this?</b>

20:27.620 --> 20:31.190
<b>I bought it.
Your favourite short cake.</b>

20:31.190 --> 20:33.940
<b>Huh? You're giving me this?</b>

20:33.940 --> 20:34.750
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:35.170 --> 20:37.610
<b>How do you know my favourite food?</b>

20:37.610 --> 20:40.210
<b>You wrote it in the anthology last year.</b>

20:40.210 --> 20:42.390
<b>You remember that...</b>

20:42.390 --> 20:43.390
<b>Wow, what a creep.</b>

20:43.390 --> 20:44.140
<b>Please don't.</b>

20:44.140 --> 20:48.390
<b>I mean, I just wrote it
on the corner of the anthology.</b>

20:48.990 --> 20:51.400
<b>I don't even remember I wrote it.</b>

20:51.770 --> 20:55.530
<b>Sorry for having strong memories, then.</b>

20:57.810 --> 20:59.030
<b>Thanks.</b>

21:03.660 --> 21:05.910
<b>You're going all-out with this one, huh?</b>

21:05.910 --> 21:07.160
<b>Have a bite.</b>

21:11.420 --> 21:15.740
<b>Well? Are you willing to
bow down to my cooking now?</b>

21:15.740 --> 21:17.920
<b>Is it good? It is, right?</b>

21:18.340 --> 21:20.050
<b>It's so good.</b>

21:20.380 --> 21:21.360
<b>That so?</b>

21:21.980 --> 21:23.550
<b>Glad to hear that.</b>

21:26.640 --> 21:28.060
<b>Strange...</b>

21:28.060 --> 21:32.170
<b>The Akane I know would say,
"I don't like the way you praise me!"</b>

21:32.170 --> 21:34.210
<b>and go berserk on me...</b>

21:34.210 --> 21:35.840
<b>What are you scheming?</b>

21:35.840 --> 21:38.570
<b>It's a lot of dishes,
so I thought you'd be overwhelmed...</b>

21:38.570 --> 21:41.770
<b>So you actually can care
about others now?</b>

21:41.770 --> 21:44.380
<b>That's very rude of you.</b>

21:44.380 --> 21:46.580
<b>I can just not help you
if you don't want me.</b>

21:48.140 --> 21:50.500
<b>That'll be lovely. Thanks.</b>

21:52.710 --> 21:54.000
<b>You're welcome.</b>

21:54.560 --> 21:55.780
<b>I see...</b>

21:55.780 --> 21:59.010
<b>I always see her mad,
so I never noticed...</b>

21:59.930 --> 22:03.510
<b>But she looks best when smiling...</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>#3   My Wife</b>
